    <string name="gmail_intro">
        Sample Gmail flow:
        1. requests readonly Gmail access for the device Google account,
        2. searches for the newest message from the sender you enter,
        3. downloads the first attachment into the app files area when one exists.

        Setup required before this works:
        - enable the Gmail API in Google Cloud,
        - create an Android OAuth client for package com.ror.nms2go,
        - add your Gmail account as a test user on the OAuth consent screen if the app is not verified.
    </string>
